OL,3,GNEWSAFirm announces #57m boost for
OL,4,APrestwick aircraft repair facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn aerospace company has announced a
OL,7,F#57m investment in aircraft maintenance
OL,8,Ffacilities next to Prestwick Airport.
OL,10,FGE Aerospace is spending #30m on the
OL,11,Fexpansion and modernisation of its
OL,12,Fmaintenance, repair and overhaul (MRO)
OL,13,Fsite in the South Ayrshire town.
OL,15,FThis will include the construction of a
OL,16,Fnew 55,000 sq ft (5109 sq m) building.
OL,17,FThe work is due to be completed by the
OL,18,Fstart of 2028.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
