OL,3,GNEWSAFirm announces #57m boost for
OL,4,APrestwick aircraft repair facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project is being supported by #27m
OL,7,Ffrom the Ayrshire Growth Deal. Scottish
OL,8,FEnterprise has also planned to invest
OL,9,F#6m.
